   "id": 532682,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Calculate the surface area of a greenhouse with a flat roof measuring 12 ft wide, 25 ft long, and 8 ft high.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The surface area of a right prism where <i>B</i> is the area of the base, <i>p</i> is the perimeter of the base, and <i>h</i> is the height is <span data-math=\"SA = 2B + ph\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The rectangular base has an area <span data-math=\"{\\text{ =  LW  =  (12 ft) (25 ft)  =  300 f}}{{\\text{t}}^{\\text{2}}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The perimeter of the base <span data-math=\"{\\text{ =  }}p{\\text{  =  2(12 ft)  +  2(25 ft)  =  74 ft}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The surface area <span data-math=\"= {\\text{ }}2B + ph = {\\text{ }}2\\left( {300{\\text{ f}}{{\\text{t}}^2}} \\right){\\text{ }} + {\\text{ }}\\left( {74{\\text{ ft}}} \\right)\\left( {8{\\text{ ft}}} \\right){\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}600{\\text{ f}}{{\\text{t}}^2} + {\\text{ }}592{\\text{ f}}{{\\text{t}}^2} = {\\text{ }}1,192{\\text{ f}}{{\\text{t}}^2}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The surface area is 1,192 square feet.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"1{,}192\\text{ ft}{^2}\">1,192\\text{ ft}{^2}</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
